  "title": "Food and drink",
  "note": "想 + verb means \"would like to\": 我想喝茶. 要 + noun asks for something: 我要一杯咖啡. To offer a choice in a question, use 还是: 茶还是咖啡？ An adjective with 了 shows a new state: 我饿了 \"I'm hungry (now).\"",
